# ============================================================
#  Contraband (threads 1, docs/threads-1-plan.md): two banned elixirs (lore brightwater, owls_ink).
#  - A bottle waits in your trunk (`*_bottle`, one of each at most) until you drink, pour or sell it
#    (content/events/contraband.grim); every dose risks a search at dawn.
#  - A dose lasts two months. When it wears off the craving may take hold (`*_want`), more likely with each dose
#    taken: four months of a little lost each month and an occasional bad day (the withdrawal pools), ended early by
#    another dose or by Sister Amaranth's remedy.
#  - Owl's Ink is the illicit exam help: a large boost to exams (`@balance boost_sizes`), well past a tonic's rung.
# ============================================================

@state brightwater_bottle
name: A Bottle of Brightwater
kind: neutral
art: bottle
desc: Hidden in your trunk, wrapped in a sock: one dose of a banned elixir, cloudy gold.

@state owls_ink_bottle
name: A Bottle of Owl's Ink
kind: neutral
art: bottle
desc: Hidden in your trunk, wrapped in a sock: one dose of a banned elixir, black and bitter.

@state brightwater
name: Brightwater
kind: buff
art: bottle
duration: 2
desc: You sleep like a stone and wake like a bell. It's lovely. It's banned.
on_add:
  lose brightwater_want
  brightwater_doses += 1
tick:
  health +4
  mood +4
on_expire:
  if brightwater_doses >= 3:
    chance likely:
      gain brightwater_want
  elif brightwater_doses == 2:
    chance even:
      gain brightwater_want
  else:
    chance unlikely:
      gain brightwater_want

@state owls_ink
name: Owl's Ink
kind: buff
art: bottle
duration: 2
boost: exam:large
desc: Your mind is a new nib and your magic a full well. Exams look small from up here.
on_add:
  lose owls_ink_want
  owls_ink_doses += 1
  mana +10
tick:
  mana +6
on_expire:
  if owls_ink_doses >= 3:
    chance likely:
      gain owls_ink_want
  elif owls_ink_doses == 2:
    chance even:
      gain owls_ink_want
  else:
    chance unlikely:
      gain owls_ink_want

@state brightwater_want
name: Wanting Brightwater
kind: debuff
art: rain
duration: 4
desc: The world has gone a shade greyer since the Brightwater wore off, and you know exactly what would fix it. Sister Amaranth, they say, has seen this before.
tick:
  mood -2
  queue any in withdrawal_brightwater in 0 chance unlikely

@state owls_ink_want
name: Wanting Owl's Ink
kind: debuff
art: rain
duration: 4
desc: Since the ink wore off your magic comes slow and the page swims, and you know exactly what would fix it. Sister Amaranth, they say, has seen this before.
tick:
  mana -3
  queue any in withdrawal_owls_ink in 0 chance unlikely
